<section class="booking" id="booking">
  <div class="booking-wrap">
    <div class="booking-info">
      <div class="section-tag">Get In Touch</div>
      <h2>Book a Job or Get a Free Quote</h2>
      <p>Fill the form and we'll send the details directly to our WhatsApp. We respond within the hour during business hours.</p>
